		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Module 01 — Implementation Status\nAs of 2026-07-29 (main-demo @ 5c65046 — declared FINAL) — candid engineering status board","x":-360,"y":-480,"width":1520,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"status-done","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Done\n- **4-phase pipeline** (~2,260 LOC, 11 src files)\n- Phase 4 **PBCTS**: LTLf progression + trace synthesis + BDA + IDCD + SCSL → Formal Reliability Certificate v2.0\n- Dynamic extractor with recovery pass; multi-round Phase 3 self-healing\n- **28 tests, all pass** (PR #79) — gates, convergence, SCSL, status codes, exports","x":-360,"y":-300,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"critical-gap","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Handoff WIRED (both directions)\n`module_02_input.json` (task_patterns) → consumed by Module 02 ✅\n`module_03_input.json` (LTLf suite) → consumed by Module 03's `property_ingest.py` (PR #72) ✅; LTLf→LTL gap bridged via alive-extension (`spot::from_ltlf`, PR #70).\nExport bug found & fixed en route: `tier_semantics` covered 3/5 tiers → hard error on real specs; regression test added.\n**Scope limit (M03-side):** only node()-free P1 properties checkable today (17.6% of tier).","x":60,"y":-320,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"startup-bug","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Cleanup day (2026-07-29)\n- **Startup bug fixed** (`bc35c02`): dead `automata_lifter` import gone; service + Docker CMD start cleanly\n- **Status codes unified** on `PASS_PBCTS_UNCONVERGED` (PR #81), pinned by test\n- **SPOT dropped from Dockerfile** (PR #82); `formula_normalizer.py` honestly labeled dead code\n- **CI added** (PR #80): per-module tests + docker-compose startup check","x":980,"y":-320,"width":380,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"zero-tests","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Tests — the 3-cycle drought is over\nPR #79 added 6 test files (28 tests, ~700 LOC): phase-1/phase-3 gates, PBCTS convergence, SCSL, status-code consistency, M03 export, `/verify` API.\n**Verified 28/28 pass in ~0.3s** (2026-07-29). Gates are finally exercised, not just asserted.","x":-360,"y":-40,"width":360,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"docs-mismatch","type":"text","text":"## ⚠ Remaining warnings\n- `docs/` was **removed from the repo** (develop @ 05fae60) — copies survive in the vault ([[Module 01 Repo Docs Index]]); the module_summery page remains **doubly stale** there.\n- Doc *targets* EAS ≥ 0.90 / SCov ≥ 0.85 **not enforced** — IDCD convergence is the only Phase 4 gate.\n- Adversarial red-teaming still simulated heuristics, no real LLM.","x":60,"y":-40,"width":400,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"verdict","type":"text","text":"## Verdict\n**Finally coherent.** PBCTS is a clean stdlib-only Phase 4, and the 2026-07-29 cleanup day closed every operational gap from the snapshot: the service starts, tests exist and pass, status codes agree, the Dockerfile is slim. The one real gap left is upstream of this module: M03 still can't ingest the LTLf suite.","x":540,"y":-40,"width":400,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"module03-link","type":"text","text":"## Module 03 (Equivalence Engine)\nHas **all 4 phases in C++** incl. SPOT model checking (`check_compliance`).\n**Ingests this module's suite** via `property_ingest.py` (PR #72); alive-extension LTLf→LTL bridge live (PR #70). E2E demonstrated (`demo/e2e_demo.py`) + measured (`demo/eval_e2e/`).","x":540,"y":-300,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"5"},
